        <div class="bar"><span>brain.png — zuvielejojos 1.1</span><span>▢</span></div>
        <div class="bd"><div class="shot"><img src="/images/brain.png" alt="Brain" class="brain-img" /></div></div>
      </div>
      <h1 class="mega">hi there. welcome to my brain.</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="max-width:36ch">i wanted to have my own corner of the internet so i vibe coded this page.</p>
      <div class="win" style="width:min(340px,100%)" role="note">
        <div class="bar"><span>System Message</span><span>!</span></div>
        <div class="bd">
          <span>If you find any bugs, you can keep them &lt;3</span>
          <div class="btnrow"><button class="wbtn" type="button">keep</button><button class="wbtn" type="button">ok</button></div>
